# WP-SEC-3: Cloudflare Pages headers (applies to every path via "/").
# NOTE: GitHub Pages ignores this file. If these headers are absent on
# https://epilabs.org/ after deploy, the site is NOT served by Cloudflare
# Pages -- stop and report instead of continuing.
#
# Script hashes below were computed by scripts/build_csp_hashes.py over
# LF-normalized inline script text (the HTML parser normalizes CRLF to LF
# before CSP hashing). Re-run the builder after any website/ change that
# touches inline scripts.
#
# One enforcing policy, no Report-Only shadow. The two reasons enforcement was
# previously deferred were both measured, and both turned out to be fixable:
#
#   * jszip. website/js/jszip.min.js ships a setImmediate polyfill that calls
#     `new Function`, but only on the non-function branch; JSZip's own call
#     passes a function, so nothing is ever evaluated. Proven in a real
#     browser under `default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'`: generateAsync,
#     loadAsync and .async() all succeed with zero violations, while a control
#     `new Function("return 1")` throws EvalError -- so the probe could detect
#     a violation and did not. 'unsafe-eval' is not needed.
#   * fonts. The ~100 font-src violations per page view came from Bunny's
#     stylesheet: 50 @font-face rules, every one resolving to
#     cdn.jsdelivr.net (woff + woff2). Google's stylesheet did the same via
#     fonts.gstatic.com. The fonts are now self-hosted from /fonts via
#     css/fonts.css, so font-src is 'self' and no font CDN sees a visitor.
#
# The only third-party script left is Cloudflare Web Analytics, which the
# edge injects; it is allowlisted explicitly instead of being left implicit.
#
# Paddle hosts were dropped: checkout is retired (see _redirects) and no page
# loads paddle.js. If checkout returns, add https://cdn.paddle.com to
# script-src and https://*.paddle.com to frame-src/connect-src.
# Trust pages (M2): never indexed, never leak a referrer (tokens in #k=).
/t/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(self "https://*.paddle.com")
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
